  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As an action, throw this bomb up to 60 feet. Make a ranged attack against a creature or object, treating the dung bomb as an improvised weapon. On a hit, the creature has disadvantage on Wisdom (@skill[Perception]) checks that rely on smell for 1 hour and disadvantage on Constitution saving throws to maintain concentration for 1 minute. If the target is a creature with an Intelligence score of 8 or lower, it must succeed on a DC 15 Constitution saving throw or immediately use its reaction to move up to its speed away from you.</p><p>Foundry: attack + stench AE are automated; the Int 8 flee save is manual.</p><p><em>Craft (Combo List): Tinker's Tools — Bomb Casing + Dung DC 15, qty 1.</em></p>",
      "chat": "<p><strong>Dung Bomb</strong></p>"
    },
